---
// NoArousal - Minimalist Centered Footer
---

<footer class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-10 pb-16 text-center border-t border-[#554936]/40">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3">
    <!-- Decorative Sword Divider -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-xs w-full mb-1 text-[#746047]" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="h-[1px] flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#746047] to-[#746047]"></span>
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 20 28"
        fill="none"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="20"
        height="28"
        style="width: 20px; height: 28px; max-width: 20px; max-height: 28px;"
        class="h-6 w-auto text-[#D6B17A] flex-shrink-0"
      >
        <circle cx="10" cy="2.5" r="1.5" fill="#D6B17A" />
        <rect x="9.25" y="4" width="1.5" height="4" rx="0.5" fill="#D6B17A" />
        <path d="M4 8.5C5.5 8.5 7 8 10 8C13 8 14.5 8.5 16 8.5C16.5 8.5 16.5 9.5 16 9.5C13 9.5 11.5 9 10 9C8.5 9 7 9.5 4 9.5C3.5 9.5 3.5 8.5 4 8.5Z" fill="#D6B17A" />
        <path d="M9.25 9.5L9.5 24.5L10 27L10.5 24.5L10.75 9.5H9.25Z" fill="#D6B17A" />
      </svg>
      <span class="h-[1px] flex-1 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent via-[#746047] to-[#746047]"></span>
    </div>

    <!-- Wordmark -->
    <span class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#E9DDC9] font-medium tracking-wide">
      NoArousal
    </span>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="font-serif italic text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#A99D8A] font-light">
      Built on intention. Measured in moments.
    </p>

    <!-- Meta -->
    <span class="font-cinzel text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[#A99D8A]/70 mt-1 select-none">
      PERSONAL TRACKER &bull; 2026
    </span>
  </div>
</footer>
